---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="About | Mohamed Meghawry"
  description="Desktop Analyst in healthcare IT, based in Toronto. Background in IT support across healthcare, higher education, and a nonprofit arts organization."
>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">About</h1>
  <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
    <p>Based in Toronto. Bachelor of Computer Science from York University. Speaks English and Arabic.</p>
    <p>Background in IT support across healthcare, higher education, and a nonprofit arts organization. Current work is desktop and endpoint support; security operations is the longer-term track.</p>
  </div>
  <section class="mt-12">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Core skills</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-700 list-disc list-inside">
      <li>Endpoint management with Microsoft Intune and Windows Autopilot</li>
      <li>Windows vulnerability remediation with Defender and ServiceNow</li>
      <li>Active Directory and Entra ID</li>
      <li>Microsoft 365 and Outlook support</li>
      <li>PowerShell for diagnostics and repeat tasks</li>
      <li>Automation with Make.com and the WhatsApp Business API</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Layout>
